  "decision_conditions": [
    "Consent is refused for the following works: T14 (Lime) and T16 (Hornbeam) - 3 - 4m height reduction, 2m width reduction.\r\n\r\nThe proposed reductions are unjustified as insufficient arboricultural evidence has been provided to demonstrate the need for the works. The extent of pruning would result in an unnecessary loss of crown cover and harm the trees' natural form and visual amenity, with no evidence of defects or other conditions requiring such intervention."
